o follow. This lecture series is a chance to make their skill development easier by enriching their knowledge with the wisdom of experts from all over the country. In the fast-paced and ever-evolving world of entrepreneurship.","imagePath":"../images/Intiatives/image02.jpg"},{"id":3,"title":"Engendea","body":"The Engendea event is a day-long event where multiple teams participate to showcase their innovation skills. The main objective of this event is for participants to present their ideas and business models, aiming to achieve great success with their concepts. The event provides a platform for participants to demonstrate their creativity, problem-solving abilities, and entrepreneurial spirit.","imagePath":"images/Intiatives/image03.jpg"},{"id":4,"title":"Workshops","body":"These interactive training sessions are organized for the entrepreneurial community to gain hands-on experience in developing successful business models and reaching out to people to publicize their products and services.The workshops organized as part of the entrepreneurial community focus on providing interactive training sessions.","imagePath":"images/Intiatives/image04.jpg"},{"id":5,"title":"Entrepreneurship Awareness Camp","body":"EAC is designed to educate and create awareness about entrepreneurship among individuals, particularly aspiring entrepreneurs. The camp aims to inspire, inform, and equip participants with the knowledge, skills, and resources necessary to start and run their own businesses.","imagePath":"images/Intiatives/image05.jpg"},{"id":6,"title":"Talk Sessions","body":"Start-up founders, successful entrepreneurs, and venture capitalists are invited to share their experiences and insights into entrepreneurship. These sessions help students broaden their knowledge, gain exposure to different fields, and interact with experts, contributing to their overall educational experience.","imagePath":"images/Intiatives/image06.jpg"}]');function xa(){return(0,pt.jsx)("section",{id:"initiatives",children:(0,pt.jsxs)("div",{className:"Initiatives bg-gradient-to-b from-[#051923] via-[#3282B885] via-[#00538169] to-[#051923] py-20",children:[(0,pt.jsxs)("div",{className:"md:flex items-center justify-center py-12 text-6xl px-12 wow animate__animated animate__fadeInUp",children:[(0,pt.jsx)("h1",{className:"hover:text-blue inline-block font-montserrat font-semibold leading-10 transition-transform duration-300 ease-out transform-gpu hover:translate-y-[-2px] hover:text-red px-2 py-4 text-white",children:"OUR"}),(0,pt.jsx)("h1",{className:"text-[#3282B8] hover:text-blue inline-block font-montserrat font-semibold leading-10 transition-transform duration-300 ease-out transform-gpu hover:translate-y-[-2px] hover:text-red px-2 py-4 ",children:"INITIATIVES"})]}),(0,pt.jsx)("div",{className:"grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-2 mx-14 md:mx-32 pb-16 gap-20 lg:mx-28 lg:gap-24 pt-12 wow animate__animated animate__fadeInUpBig",children:wa.map((function(e){return(0,pt.jsx)(ya,{title:e.title,body:e.body,imagePath:e.imagePath},e.id)}))})]})})}var ka=function(e){var n=l((0,t.useState)("box invis"),2),a=n[0],r=n[1],i=l((0,t.useState)(0),2),o=(i[0],i[1],l((0,t.useState)(""),2)),s=o[0],c=o[1],u=l((0,t.useState)(""),2),d=u[0],f=u[1];return(0,pt.jsx)("section",{id:"events",children:(0,pt.jsxs)("div",{className:"py-16 md:py-24",children:[(0,pt.jsxs)("div",{className:a,children:[(0,pt.jsx)("h3",{className:"mt-3 text-center text-4xl font-black disp_head pt-6 pb-4",children:s}),(0,pt.jsx)("div",{className:"data",children:d}),(0,pt.jsx)("button",{className:"disp_btn",onClick:function(){r("box invis")},children:(0,pt.jsx)(ft,{})})]}),(0,pt.jsxs)("div",{className:"flex flex-col justify-center items-center px-8 pb-20",children:[(0,pt.jsxs)("h1",{className:"text-center pt-10 pb-20 md:pb-28 text-6xl font-semibold wow animate__animated animate__fadeInUp",children:["Recent ",(0,pt.jsx)("span",{className:"text-[#0060a1]",children:"Events"})]}),(0,pt.jsx)("div",{className:"flex justify-center i